OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland owner in crunch talks
OL,4,Awith as retailer's collapse looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness Secretary Jonathan Reynolds
OL,7,Fwill meet the US-based owners of
OL,8,FPoundland on Wednesday as the
OL,9,Fgovernment hopes to save the retailer
OL,10,Ffrom collapse.
OL,12,FThe discount chain is on the brink of
OL,13,Finsolvency and Gordon Brothers, which
OL,14,Fbought it for #1 last June, has
OL,15,Frejected a takeover bid which could
OL,16,Fhave saved the 12,000 jobs currently at
OL,17,Frisk.
OL,19,FA meeting was due to be held on
OL,20,FThursday but has been brought forward
OL,21,Fas the scramble to secure a rescue deal
OL,22,Ffor the firm intensifies.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
